<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

    <main class="container page page-about">
        <section class="about-page reveal-on-scroll">
            <span class="eyebrow">About Me</span>
            <h1>Building Technical and Creative Experiences</h1>

            <p>
                I'm a software engineer and game developer studying at BCIT. I build across the whole stack: a custom C++ game engine with its own entity-component system and OpenGL renderer, Unity games with hand-made assets, full-stack web apps in Node.js, Express, and Next.js, and a neural network that detects AI-generated music.
            </p>

            <p>
                I like polished systems, with clean architecture underneath and a strong user experience on top. Alongside my coursework I have worked on industry-sponsored projects for the BCIT Centre for Ecocities and Webmainland Media, built websites for a student club and a barbershop quartet, and produced music and video, which you can find on this site.
            </p>

            <div class="about-grid">
                <article class="about-card">
                    <h2>What I Work On</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Game Development</li>
                        <li>Custom Engines and Tools</li>
                        <li>Web Applications</li>
                        <li>AI and Software Projects</li>
                        <li>Music and Video Production</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>

                <article class="about-card">
                    <h2>What I Value</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Clean Architecture</li>
                        <li>Strong UX and Presentation</li>
                        <li>Iterative Development</li>
                        <li>Creative Experimentation</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>

    <script src="/js/main.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>"></script>
    <script src="/js/nav.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
